[
  {
    "index": 0,
    "text": "Lesson 137 A pleasant",
    "start": 0.77,
    "end": 4.832,
    "zh": "第137课 一个愉快的",
    "zh_hant": "第137課 一個愉快的"
  },
  {
    "index": 1,
    "text": "dream",
    "start": 4.572,
    "end": 5.473,
    "zh": "梦",
    "zh_hant": "夢"
  },
  {
    "index": 2,
    "text": "Listen to the tape then answer this question.",
    "start": 6.453,
    "end": 10.815,
    "zh": "听录音，然后回答这个问题。",
    "zh_hant": "聽錄音，然後回答這個問題。"
  },
  {
    "index": 3,
    "text": "What would Julie like to do, if",
    "start": 11.676,
    "end": 15.317,
    "zh": "如果朱莉",
    "zh_hant": "如果朱莉"
  },
  {
    "index": 4,
    "text": "she had the money?",
    "start": 15.018,
    "end": 16.598,
    "zh": "有钱，她愿意做什么？",
    "zh_hant": "有錢，她願意做什麼？"
  },
  {
    "index": 5,
    "text": "Are you doing the football pools, Brain?",
    "start": 18.939,
    "end": 23.001,
    "zh": "布赖恩，你在填足球彩票吗？",
    "zh_hant": "布賴恩，你在填足球彩票嗎？"
  },
  {
    "index": 6,
    "text": "Yes, I've nearly finished, Julie.",
    "start": 23.542,
    "end": 26.583,
    "zh": "是的，我快填完了，朱莉。",
    "zh_hant": "是的，我快填完了，朱莉。"
  },
  {
    "index": 7,
    "text": "I'm sure we'll win something this week.",
    "start": 26.943,
    "end": 30.045,
    "zh": "我肯定这周我们会赢点什么。",
    "zh_hant": "我肯定這周我們會贏點什麼。"
  },
  {
    "index": 8,
    "text": "You always say that,",
    "start": 30.605,
    "end": 33.246,
    "zh": "你总是这么说，",
    "zh_hant": "你總是這麼說，"
  },
  {
    "index": 9,
    "text": "but we never win anything!",
    "start": 33.187,
    "end": 36.228,
    "zh": "但咱们从来没赢过！",
    "zh_hant": "但咱們從來沒贏過！"
  },
  {
    "index": 10,
    "text": "What will you do if you win a lot of money?",
    "start": 36.788,
    "end": 40.871,
    "zh": "如果你赢了很多钱，你会做什么？",
    "zh_hant": "如果你贏了很多錢，你會做什麼？"
  },
  {
    "index": 11,
    "text": "If I win a lot of money",
    "start": 41.671,
    "end": 44.092,
    "zh": "如果我赢了很多钱，",
    "zh_hant": "如果我贏了很多錢，"
  },
  {
    "index": 12,
    "text": "I'll buy you a mink coat.",
    "start": 44.653,
    "end": 47.294,
    "zh": "我会给你买一件貂皮大衣。",
    "zh_hant": "我會給你買一件貂皮大衣。"
  },
  {
    "index": 13,
    "text": "I don't want a mink coat!",
    "start": 47.974,
    "end": 50.695,
    "zh": "我不要貂皮大衣！",
    "zh_hant": "我不要貂皮大衣！"
  },
  {
    "index": 14,
    "text": "I want to see the world.",
    "start": 51.296,
    "end": 54.097,
    "zh": "我想去看看世界。",
    "zh_hant": "我想去看看世界。"
  },
  {
    "index": 15,
    "text": "All right.",
    "start": 54.818,
    "end": 55.898,
    "zh": "好吧。",
    "zh_hant": "好吧。"
  },
  {
    "index": 16,
    "text": "If we win a lot of money",
    "start": 56.499,
    "end": 58.919,
    "zh": "如果我们赢了很多钱，",
    "zh_hant": "如果我們贏了很多錢，"
  },
  {
    "index": 17,
    "text": "we'll travel round the world",
    "start": 59.14,
    "end": 61.861,
    "zh": "我们就环球旅行，",
    "zh_hant": "我們就環球旅行，"
  },
  {
    "index": 18,
    "text": "and we'll stay at the best hotels.",
    "start": 61.721,
    "end": 64.902,
    "zh": "并且住最好的旅馆。",
    "zh_hant": "並且住最好的旅館。"
  },
  {
    "index": 19,
    "text": "Then we'll return home",
    "start": 65.403,
    "end": 67.684,
    "zh": "然后我们回家，",
    "zh_hant": "然後我們回家，"
  },
  {
    "index": 20,
    "text": "and buy a big house in the country.",
    "start": 67.824,
    "end": 71.346,
    "zh": "在乡下买一座大房子。",
    "zh_hant": "在鄉下買一座大房子。"
  },
  {
    "index": 21,
    "text": "We'll have a beautiful garden and...",
    "start": 71.866,
    "end": 75.628,
    "zh": "我们会有一个漂亮的花园，还有……",
    "zh_hant": "我們會有一個漂亮的花園，還有……"
  },
  {
    "index": 22,
    "text": "But if we spend all that money",
    "start": 75.768,
    "end": 79.049,
    "zh": "但是如果我们把那些钱都花掉，",
    "zh_hant": "但是如果我們把那些錢都花掉，"
  },
  {
    "index": 23,
    "text": "we'll be poor again.",
    "start": 79.05,
    "end": 81.332,
    "zh": "我们又会变穷了。",
    "zh_hant": "我們又會變窮了。"
  },
  {
    "index": 24,
    "text": "What'll we do then?",
    "start": 81.753,
    "end": 84.175,
    "zh": "那到时候我们该怎么办？",
    "zh_hant": "那到時候我們該怎麼辦？"
  },
  {
    "index": 25,
    "text": "If we spend all the money",
    "start": 85.257,
    "end": 87.699,
    "zh": "如果我们把钱都花光，",
    "zh_hant": "如果我們把錢都花光，"
  },
  {
    "index": 26,
    "text": "we'll try and win the football pools again.",
    "start": 87.939,
    "end": 91.522,
    "zh": "我们就再试着赢一次足球彩票。",
    "zh_hant": "我們就再試著贏一次足球彩票。"
  },
  {
    "index": 27,
    "text": "It's a pleasant dream",
    "start": 92.264,
    "end": 94.325,
    "zh": "这是个愉快的梦，",
    "zh_hant": "這是個愉快的夢，"
  },
  {
    "index": 28,
    "text": "but everything depends on 'if' !",
    "start": 94.546,
    "end": 98.35,
    "zh": "但一切都取决于“如果”！",
    "zh_hant": "但一切都取決於“如果”！"
  }
]
